# TDDFT/6-31G*/B3LYP5 closed-shell triplet gradient (lowest triplet) of H2O
# Conventional RPA on the closed-shell RKS reference ([scf] type=rhf,
# multiplicity=1); [tdhf] multiplicity=3 selects the triplet response
# (no Coulomb term, f_aa - f_ab XC kernel); gradient of the lowest triplet.
